<title>UK: Guinness up as Goldman adds to buy-list.</title>
<headline>Guinness up as Goldman adds to buy-list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Guinness Plc rose on Tuesday after brokerage Goldman &amp; Sachs added the stock to its recommendation list, traders said.</p>
<p>By 1010 GMT Guinness gained 5-1/2p to 585-1/2p.</p>
<p>&quot;They see the stock as an outperformer and recommended Guinness as a buy&quot;, a market-maker said.</p>
<p>An analyst at Goldman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
